{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "Ethan woke up to the sound of birds chirping and a gentle breeze rustling through the trees. He rubbed his eyes and sat up, only to realize that the world around him was too vivid, too detailed to be real. The grass beneath his hands was a lush green, the sky a perfect blue, and the trees towered over him in a way that felt almost sentient. He stood up, his body moving with a newfound lightness, and looked around. This wasn't his apartment. This wasn't even his neighborhood. He was standing in a vast, open field, and in the distance, he could see a small village nestled between rolling hills. As he took a step forward, a notification popped up in his vision: \"Welcome to Eldoria, traveler. Your adventure begins now.\"\n\nEthan's heart raced as he tried to make sense of it all. He flexed his fingers, half-expecting them to phase through the world like a glitch, but they felt solid, real. He pinched himself, wincing at the sharp pain that followed. This was insane. He had to be dreaming, but even in his wildest dreams, nothing had ever felt this real. He took a deep breath, deciding to embrace the absurdity of it all. If this was a game, then he was Ethan, the player. And if he was the player, then he had a world to explore. With a grin, he set off towards the village, his mind buzzing with possibilities. After all, in a world like this, what was stopping him from being a hero? *** The village was bustling with activity when Ethan arrived, the scent of freshly baked bread and roasting meat filling the air. The villagers, dressed in what looked like medieval garb, went about their business, seemingly oblivious to the fact that a man from the future had just walked into their midst. A young girl with curly hair and a wide smile approached him, her eyes sparkling with curiosity. \"You must be new here,\" she said, her voice musical and warm. \"I'm Lina. Welcome to Eldoria.\" Ethan hesitated for a moment before smiling back. \"Yeah, I guess I am,\" he replied, feeling a strange mix of excitement and trepidation. He was in a video game. And somehow, he was part of it now.", "logprobs": [{"token": "E", "logprob": -1.2762786149978638}, {"token": "than", "logprob": -0.0006055190460756421}, {"token": " woke", "logprob": -3.2146801948547363}, {"token": " up", "logprob": -0.3102710247039795}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.08645821362733841}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.02177579514682293}, {"token": " sound", "logprob": -0.1610085517168045}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -5.602820692729438e-06}, {"token": " birds", "logprob": -0.5807998776435852}, {"token": " chir", "logprob": -0.003390043042600155}, {"token": "ping", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -1.1775472164154053}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.561650276184082}, {"token": " gentle", "logprob": -1.3373792171478271}, {"token": " breeze", "logprob": -0.010084747336804867}, {"token": " rust", "logprob": -0.013184980489313602}, {"token": "ling", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": " through", "logprob": -0.5304595232009888}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.7157981991767883}, {"token": " trees", "logprob": -0.47639262676239014}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.19564782083034515}, {"token": " He", "logprob": -0.2995569705963135}, {"token": " rubbed", "logprob": -0.7840439677238464}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -3.6954195820726454e-05}, {"token": " eyes", "logprob": -6.007967749610543e-05}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.9803299307823181}, {"token": " sat", "logprob": -0.3363953232765198}, {"token": " up", "logprob": -1.2397689715726301e-05}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.003278121817857027}, {"token": " only", "logprob": -0.18056808412075043}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " realize", "logprob": -0.189070463180542}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.5320937037467957}, {"token": " the", "logpr